  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "Finally! There you are! What took you so long? I\u2019ve been staring
      at this dusty street for twenty minutes!"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Sorry, bro! I was just taking my time and enjoying the view.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "The view? In this dead town? You\u2019re weirder than the Forest Ranger."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "There\u2019s nothing to see here until I finally leave for the city. Just
      take the bag and get out of here."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: With pleasure.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: Alright, here's the parcel, deliver it safe and sound for me, take care!
    Choices: []
